<title>MEXICO: Pemex says spilled 200 liters of crude on Monday.</title>
<headline>Pemex says spilled 200 liters of crude on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) spilled 200 litres of crude at its Pacific export port Salina Cruz on Monday, a Pemex spokeswoman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Radio reports on Wednesday said the oil leak from a Pemex tanker could have damaged local marine life, but Pemex officials said the leak was minor and did not do any harm.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
